  "id": "anosognosia",
  "term": "anosognosia",
  "definition": "Anosognosia is a lack of awareness of, or denial of, a cognitive problem. In the context of mild cognitive impairment, it refers to a person having cognitive deficits while not recognizing or reporting them.",
